      <div class="entry-content" data-io-article-url="https://www.indyturk.com/node/755133/d%C3%BCnya/mahmut-ar%C4%B1kan-faturay%C4%B1-halka-kesip-%C3%BClke-kaynaklar%C4%B1n%C4%B1-bir-avu%C3%A7-yanda%C5%9Fa-aktarmaktan">
